    "description": "Run requests top to bottom. Logging in saves the token automatically. Log in as a teacher for teacher requests and as a student for student requests. Demo accounts after \"npm run seed\": teacher@demo.edu and asha@demo.edu, password DemoPass123. Demo class join code: SCI101.",
